{"id":"odnako","lemma":"однако","pos":"adv","rank":595,"glosses":["however, yet, still","probably"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/63/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Однако этого не случилось.","en":"However, that didn't happen.","words":[null,null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"}]},{"text":"Однако это невозможно.","en":"This, however, isn't possible.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"it is impossible"}]},{"text":"Вы можете играть на этом фортепиано, однако не ночью.","en":"You can play this piano, but not at night.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to play"},{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"piano"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"at night, by night"}]},{"text":"Ты однако и впрямь часто так делаешь.","en":"You sure do do that a lot.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"really, indeed"},{"g":"frequently, often"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]},{"text":"Однако я не очень хорошо говорю по-английски.","en":"However, I'm not good at speaking English.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"well, right"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"along / by"},{"g":"only used in…"}]}]}